# metatrain ruff (CI lint)

The [lint job](https://github.com/EricBoittier/metatrain/actions) runs `tox -e lint`, which starts with:

```bash
ruff format --diff src/ tests/ examples/ developer/ docs/src/
ruff check src/ tests/ examples/ developer/ docs/src/
```

After any `metatrain/**/*.py` change, run the same ruff as CI (local binary: `metatrain/.tox/lint/bin/ruff`) on every file you touched, then fix I001/import sort and format diffs before you stop. Do not push a metatrain commit that `ruff check` or `ruff format --diff` would fail.

```bash
# from the metatrain checkout
.tox/lint/bin/ruff format <files>
.tox/lint/bin/ruff check --fix <files>
```
